{
  "id": 407579992,
  "iid": 20913,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "qt: fix mnemonic handling for plugin menu items in funnel_statistics",
  "description": "Fixes #20594.\n\nProblem\n-------\nWe were replacing every '&' with '&&', which disabled Qt mnemonics for\nplugin-provided menu titles (e.g. \"Test&1\" never showed a mnemonic).\n\nFix\n---\nOnly unescape HTML \"&amp;\" to \"&\". Do not touch single '&' (Qt uses it\nfor mnemonics) nor \"&&\" (literal '&').\n\nTesting\n-------\nWith a Lua plugin:\n - \"Test&1\"   -> mnemonic on '1'\n - \"Test&&2\"  -> literal '&'\n - \"Test&amp;3\" -> becomes \"Test&3\"",
  "state": "opened",
  "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:07:22.017Z",
