      "title": "qt: funnel_statistics: fix memonic handling for plugin menu titles",
      "message": "qt: funnel_statistics: fix memonic handling for plugin menu titles\n\nOnly unescape HTML \"&amp,\" to \"&\" so Qt can interrupt single '&' as\nmemonic and \"&&\" as a literal ampersand. This restores expected behavior\nfor plugin-provided menu items (e.g., Lua register_menu).\n",
      "author_name": "Santiago Lanzarote",
      "author_email": "santiago.lanzarote@student.uclouvain.be",
      "authored_date": "2025-08-16T00:35:57.000+02:00",
